{"server":"jp","storyId":"main_3_level_main_03-07_end","groupId":"main_3","stageId":"main_03-07","title":"とどろく","storyCode":"3-7","avgTag":"戦闘後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/jp/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_03-07_end.txt","sourceHash":"6f8450258dc067e22390ddf303ac7972b9371554457be5e143aed622d753b6b3","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第二十九关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_a"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"ミーシャのことはWが連れて行ってくれたはず……！　ここは俺たちで、なんとか時間を稼ぐぞ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"こいつらを絶対に通すな！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"ああ！　好きにさせてたまるかってんだ！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ホシグマ","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"――死にたくなければ、おとなしく道をあけろ！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"う、うわああっ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フランカ","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"あ～らら……そういえばロドスにも、ああいう乱暴な戦い方する人がいたわよね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フランカ","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"あの刑事さんとなら、気が合いそうだと思わない？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"リスカム","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"よそ見しないの！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"リスカム","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"ほら、動いて！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フランカ","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"は～いはい、わかったわかった。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"エクシア","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"あははっ！　前から聞いてはいたけど、督察隊の噂って本当だったんだね～。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"テキサス","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"いいから集中しろ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"エクシア","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"大丈夫大丈夫！　こうやってお喋りしながら……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"エクシア","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"ちゃんと周りも見てるんだから！　――はい、バーン！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン術師","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"ぐあっ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"エクシア","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"へっへ～ん。そこに隠れてる攻撃部隊、気付かれてないとでも思ってたのかな？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"テキサス","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"やるな。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"エクシア","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"でしょ？　ふっふっふ～。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"テキサス","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"……では、我々も行くとしよう。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"テキサス","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"雇い主を放ってはおけないしな。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"ミーシャさんの姿はありましたか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フランカ","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"さっぱりね。それらしい痕跡も見当たらないわ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フランカ","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"もしかすると、Wに連れて行かれたのかも。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フランカ","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"ほんと、逃げ足だけは速いんだから――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"っ……！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"今の爆発は……！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"フランカさん、全隊を招集してください！　近衛局の支援に回らなければ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局隊員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"ロドスの皆さん、どうかお気をつけて！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局隊員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"相手はあの……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局隊員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"……待てよ……そんなこと、ありえるのか……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……？　どういうことですか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"それに、相手というのは――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"――え？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"あれは……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"ど、どうして彼が……！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"……何、だと……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"チッ、一体どういうからくりだ？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"――奇跡だ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"奇跡が起きたんだ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"――――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"何が、どうなって……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"――ぼやぼやするな、遮蔽物を探すんだ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_1_back"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"本当に、こんなことが……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"お前……なのか？　生きてたんだな！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"無事だったのか！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"よ、よかった……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"スカルシュレッダーは生きてる！　生きてるぞ！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"スカルシュレッダー！　本物のスカルシュレッダーだ！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"万歳！！　万歳！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_a"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……まさか……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……そんな、はずが……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"レユニオンの連中……隊長格の復帰で、士気が高まったようだな。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"厄介なことになったものだ。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"……実際、不利な状況に変わりはない。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"だが、お前が戻ってきてくれただけでも……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"よかったよ。……本当に、よかった……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"……きっと今頃、ミーシャも無事に離脱を終えているだろう。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカルシュレッダー","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"となれば、俺たちも安心して博打が打てるって寸法だ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカルシュレッダー","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"――いいや。俺が、ここで奴らの足止めをする。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカルシュレッダー","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"お前たちは、早く行け。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカルシュレッダー","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"背中は守ってやる。だから――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"何言ってんだよ、スカルシュレッダー。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"俺たち、約束してただろ？　一緒にウルサスへ帰って、あの連中を懲らしめてやろうってさ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカルシュレッダー","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカルシュレッダー","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"とにかく、自分の安全に気を配ってくれ。……死ぬなよ。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"そんな……そんなことって……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"何をしている、ぼーっとするな！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"ホシグマ、包囲に当たっている局員たちへ連絡を！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"トラップと伏兵はあらかた排除したが、敵幹部であるW及び、保護対象の人物は依然未確認の状況だ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"ゆえに、作戦を変更する。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"今すぐ、包囲を崩してレユニオンの挟撃に回れと伝えろ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"どう、して……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……こんなことに……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"…………"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["アーミヤ"]},{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["チェン"]},{"speakerId":"char_015_lmg","aliases":["近衛局隊員"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["レユニオン構成員"]},{"speakerId":"char_102_texas","aliases":["テキサス"]},{"speakerId":"char_103_angel","aliases":["エクシア"]},{"speakerId":"ch